{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","blocks":{"heading":{"type":"text","name":"Title","settings":{"text":"<p>Mit Herz für Haustiere!<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-heading--family)","font_size":"2rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground-heading)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_nMqXwC":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Wir sind <strong>Julian (22)<\/strong> und <strong>Alex (24)<\/strong>, zwei Tierliebhaber, die PetWorld gegründet haben, um Haustierbesitzern personalisierbare Produkte zu bieten, die sowohl funktional als auch einzigartig sind.<\/p><p> <\/p><p>In der ersten Phase konzentrieren wir uns auf Produkte wie <strong>Puzzle<\/strong>, <strong>Poster<\/strong>, <strong>Kalender<\/strong>, <strong>Kissen<\/strong>, <strong>Hundebetten<\/strong> und <strong>Tassen<\/strong> – alles personalisierbar, damit du etwas ganz Besonderes für dein Haustier kreieren kannst. Unsere Produkte werden von einem erfahrenen Partner produziert, der sich auf hochwertige, personalisierbare Artikel spezialisiert hat.<\/p><p> <\/p><p><strong>Warum PetWorld?<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>Individuell<\/strong>: Gestalte Produkte, die deine Persönlichkeit und die deines Haustiers widerspiegeln.<\/li><li><strong>Qualität<\/strong>: Wir bieten dir nur Produkte, die langlebig und sorgfältig gefertigt sind.<\/li><li><strong>Einfach<\/strong>: Deine Bestellung wird schnell und zuverlässig zu dir nach Hause geliefert.<\/li><\/ul><p><em><strong>PetWorld ist mehr als nur ein Shop – es geht darum, das Leben mit deinem Haustier noch schöner und persönlicher zu gestalten.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["heading","text_nMqXwC"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"content_direction":"column","gap":32,"color_scheme":"scheme-7e76d070-642f-4b91-91c1-b5364c47dceb","padding-block-start":48,"padding-block-end":48}},"section_XU7f43":{"type":"section","blocks":{"text_yJQBen":{"type":"text","name":"Title","settings":{"text":"<p>Zahlung & Versand<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-heading--family)","font_size":"2rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground-heading)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_VhDH6E":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Zuletzt aktualisiert: April 2025<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"center","type_preset":"custom","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"0.875rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"group_gQfhbb":{"type":"group","name":"1. Liefergebiet","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":5,"wid